irecrackers in Delhi NCR as imposed", "words": [[95.29, 95.43, " The"], [95.43, 95.65, " top"], [95.65, 95.81, " court"], [95.81, 96.15, " further"], [96.15, 96.45, " said"], [96.45, 96.97, " that"], [96.97, 97.07, " the"], [97.07, 97.37, " complete"], [97.37, 97.71, " ban"], [97.71, 97.83, " on"], [97.83, 98.57, " firecrackers"], [98.57, 98.75, " in"], [98.75, 98.89, " Delhi"], [98.89, 99.31, " NCR"], [99.31, 99.67, " as"], [99.67, 99.97, " imposed"]]}, {"start": 99.97, "end": 103.21, "text": "earlier shall be restored with effect from 9th of November.", "words": [[99.97, 100.37, " earlier"], [100.37, 100.97, " shall"], [100.97, 101.13, " be"], [101.13, 101.57, " restored"], [101.57, 101.81, " with"], [101.81, 102.15, " effect"], [102.15, 102.37, " from"], [102.37, 102.75, " 9th"], [102.75, 102.85, " of"], [102.85, 103.21, " November."]]}, {"start": 103.83, "end": 108.11, "text": "The government has notified the Vikasiddh Bharat Guarantee for Rosgarh and RGV Commission", "words": [[103.83, 104.01, " The"], [104.01, 104.25, " government"], [104.25, 104.53, " has"], [104.53, 105.03, " notified"], [105.03, 105.31, " the"], [105.31, 105.81, " Vikasiddh"], [105.81, 106.17, " Bharat"], [106.17, 106.57, " Guarantee"], [106.57, 106.83, " for"], [106.83, 107.29, " Rosgarh"], [107.29, 107.41, " and"], [107.41, 107.77, " RGV"], [107.77, 108.11, " Commission"]]}, {"start": 108.11, "end": 115.13, "text": "Grameel VBG Ramji grievance redressal rules 2026, establishing a structured, multi-tier", "words": [[108.11, 108.81, " Grameel"], [108.81, 109.37, " VBG"], [109.37, 109.83, " Ramji"], [109.83, 110.35, " grievance"], [110.35, 110.83, " redressal"], [110.83, 111.09, " rules"], [111.09, 112.17, " 2026,"], [112.69, 113.13, " establishing"], [113.13, 113.53, " a"], [113.53, 113.89, " structured,"], [114.49, 114.79, " multi"], [114.79, 115.13, "-tier"]]}, {"start": 115.13, "end": 120.49, "text": "and time-bound mechanism for addressing grievances relating to the implementation of th